// Text outputs are [u8] UTF-8 bytes. Input strings use UTF-16 units. lang: 0 = ko, 1 = en. reason: 0 time, 1 delegations, 2 commands,
// 3 reviews, 4 checks. Card error kind: 0 missing, 1 deliverable, 2 done, 3 targets, 4 verify, 5 conflicts, 6 state.

// UTF-8 template source for m6_test/gen_text.py.
// text pre_0_1: The request budget limit (
